ved little to no love in regards to editing, but no more! Is with pleasure that I give you the `MeshLibrary` editor:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1350\" height=\"339\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260312_150640\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/588f62a9-be81-465c-a966-baaac6b2ac1f\" />\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\nThis new bottom editor comes with the following features:\r\n- Presentation of items in a grid, with search and zooming.\r\n- Editing of individual items in a separate inspector.\r\n- Full undo/redo for all actions.\r\n- Fallback preview to an item's mesh in case none was specifically set.\r\n\r\nSupersedes #116736.\r\nSupersedes #115281.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSome extra changes were necessary for this PR:\r\n- A new `MeshLibrary` method: `get_item_count()`.\r\n- Exposure of `Resource.copy_from()` (as `copy_from_resource()`, to not clash with `Image.copy_from()`).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/m